# Rules and conventions — expenses-tracking-frontend

## Environment & package management
- **Node.js**: Use version `24.16.0` (see `.nvmrc`).
- **Always** use `pnpm` — never npm or yarn.

## Folder structure
| Folder | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `src/components/` | Reusable presentational UI |
| `src/pages/` | Route-level views (one page per route) |
| `src/hooks/` | Custom hooks |
| `src/store/` | Zustand stores (one file per domain) |
| `src/lib/` | Singleton clients and pure utilities (`supabase.ts`) |
| `src/services/` or `src/api/` | Backend HTTP calls — **never** call `fetch` from components |
| `src/types/` | Shared TypeScript types |

## State management
- Use **Zustand** for global state; small, focused stores (`useAuthStore`, `useTemplateStore`, …).
- Do not use Redux, MobX, or Context API for global app state.
- Read `session` / `user` from `useAuthStore` in components — do not call `supabase.auth.getSession()` in UI code.

## React components
- Functional components and hooks only.
- **Named exports** for components (`export function Auth()`). Default export only for `App.tsx` / `main.tsx` entry.
- One component per file; filename **PascalCase** matching the component (`Auth.tsx`).
- Type props with `interface` (e.g. `interface ButtonProps { ... }`).
- Use `.tsx` for components.

## Styling & icons
- **Tailwind** utility classes inline — no CSS modules or styled-components.
- Icons: **lucide-react** only.
- Global styles only in `src/index.css` (`@tailwind` layers).

## Authentication
- Supabase client: `src/lib/supabase.ts` only.
- Session lifecycle: `useAuthStore.initialize()` from `App.tsx` on mount.
- Route guards: check `session` from the store; redirect with `<Navigate />`.
- Sign-out: `useAuthStore.signOut()`.
- Backend calls: attach `Authorization: Bearer ${session.access_token}` in the services layer.

## API / data
- All NestJS (or future GraphQL) calls go through `src/services/`.
- Components consume data via stores or hooks that wrap services.
- Handle loading and error state in the store or page, not buried inside leaf components.

## Language & copy
- User-facing UI text in **Polish** unless the task specifies otherwise.
- Code comments and identifiers in **English**.

## Documentation
- See `AGENTS.md` for commands and overview.
- Update `docs/architecture.md` when adding routes or major data flows.
